WEBVTT

00:03:32.196 --> 00:03:33.895
PCJ: Thank you so much, Alok.

00:03:33.919 --> 00:03:36.768
The Race to Zero is a race we'll win

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:38.855
or lose together.

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:43.403
No one better than a climate champion
to describe what that means.

00:03:43.427 --> 00:03:46.109
His official title indeed is

00:03:46.133 --> 00:03:49.950
high-level climate action champion
of the United Kingdom

00:03:49.974 --> 00:03:53.109
for next year's United Nations
climate conference.

00:03:53.133 --> 00:03:55.066
Please welcome Nigel Topping.

00:03:56.168 --> 00:03:59.773
[Nigel Topping]